# Purpose: Reformat the publication Table 1 as one two-cohort balance table,
#          consistent with Gupta et al. (JAMA Internal Medicine 2026), while
#          preserving the locked, completed datasets and their stored ATO weights.
# Source code/method: WeightIt overlap weighting with bias-reduced logistic regression;
#                     locked weight objects generated by 03_fit_cbps_ate_weights.R.
# Citation/version: Li F, Morgan KL, Zaslavsky AM. JASA. 2018;113:390-400;
#                   Gupta AB, et al. JAMA Intern Med. 2026;186:192-202.
# Access date: 2026-08-19
# Adaptation: no propensity-score or outcome model is refitted. Each of 20 locked
#             completed datasets is summarised with its stored ATO weights; displayed
#             descriptive statistics are arithmetic means across completed datasets.
# Verification command:
#   D:/software/R4.4.2/R-4.4.2/bin/x64/Rscript.exe --vanilla 22_rebuild_table1_jama_style_ato.R

